flowchart LR
    Q[Symbol]
    Q --> G[Graph backend]
    Q --> B[Lexical baseline<br/>deterministic text scan]

    G --> GC[Reported caller files]
    B --> BC[Detectable direct caller files]

    GC --> C{Compare}
    BC --> C

    C -->|sets match| P[PASS]
    C -->|baseline has extra| F[FAIL<br/>possible index gap]

    style P fill:#dafbe1,stroke:#2da44e,color:#116329
    style F fill:#ffebe9,stroke:#cf222e,color:#82071e
